{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_8_level_main_08-08_end","groupId":"main_8","stageId":"main_08-08","title":"人心，向背无常","storyCode":"R8-8","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_08-08_end.txt","sourceHash":"fbdd0b4a91dd6f767e1e805e88fa5bea7584ad89669846e5818cdbac3ae1ceb5","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snow_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"清点伤亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正如你所想，这场将我们当作诱饵的战斗发生了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你失望吗，塔露拉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"——不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"他们做这一切都有原因，我也知道原因。这些确切的理由会阻止我产生过高的期望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......告密者应当被处死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我们要如何从这些想自战场逃开的人里选出一个叛徒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些人为了片刻的喘息出卖了同胞。对他们的袒护是对战士的伤害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"不，他们从来就没有“忠诚”过，先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"要求队伍里的每个人都是完人？不可能的。不会存在这样的队伍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"游击队——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"游击队的战士们也不是完人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"你们中想得多的人也就那么些，其他的人，是因为种种原因留了下来愿意付出，却不一定想得清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"退下吧，士兵。不用与她争辩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"摧毁一座城市比建立一座城市简单得多，先生。让他们留着吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"如果感染者可以通过各种办法活下来，那我宁可这些方法统统都奏效。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉，你是不能设想，不去做出牺牲的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"牺牲......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"这难道该是我来下决定吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们很多人都已经做好了准备。不流血，无以得胜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很清楚。你我都很清楚。你所谓的去南方，是一场战争的导火索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帝国不会坐视感染者团结壮大。如果真如你宣传的那样，感染者将以一系列行为改变自己的命运，这场战争就在所难免。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"——是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我们首先要让感染者清楚，自己的生命是有意义的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"之后再发生的那些，感染者都没有义务去面对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想游击队参与这场战争？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉，你是想等到一场你能从中获利、找到机会的乌萨斯与他国的战争......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是你想自己发动这场战争？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"（沉默）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不想做回答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别妄想能有一个不惨烈的胜利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"也许如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"但我不会去牺牲别人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你准备好承担巨大的痛苦了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有准备。因为我们必定受苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你企盼所有人都善良？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是相信自私和残忍不会是乌萨斯人的天性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许有一天，你会遭遇真正的邪恶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我想我已经见过了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但愿如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"如果有战士曾向他的队伍和他的同胞宣誓效忠，最后却因一己之利而背叛，那这种行为，我自己就会发布惩处名单。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"但与我们还未同心的另一群感染者，我们有什么理由去对他们发动一场屠杀，一场征服？我们的敌人不在此处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"您说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾尊敬过许多人，大多不因他们强大，而只因他们正直。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——望汝如是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"......谨记教诲，先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"佩特洛娃，霜星的位置呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"......还在山坳口那。她说要守住据点直到我们成功夺下城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我们去和他们合流吧。我得当面向她道歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"所以......就这样了吗，大尉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少还有三支本地驻军在附近。我们要将他们各个击破，才能把资源送出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从结果来说她做的没错。移动城市不可能向前走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snow_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_084","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，塔露拉姐姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_084","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_084","isRemote":false,"text":"你心情不好吗，塔露拉姐姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"......伊诺，萨沙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"你们还想叫你们原本的名字吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":"avg_npc_085","isRemote":false,"text":"......为什么这么问？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我们行走在外，有一个保护自己的名字比较好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"有的时候，如果自己不选名字，就只能一直被别人叫他们取的名字了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":"avg_npc_085","isRemote":false,"text":"可是你没有换过名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"因为我不想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":"avg_npc_085","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么？这和你刚才说的不一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"因为......因为我想成为一个表里如一的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":"avg_npc_085","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你现在想的和做的不是一回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_084","isRemote":false,"text":"萨沙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"很可能，没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我要坚持这个名字。只不过，对于所有人来说，这个名字没有意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"因为我是谁对于大家来说并不重要。这个名字只对我自己重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":"avg_npc_085","isRemote":false,"text":"那我到底该叫你什么？你这么说，我不知道该怎么叫你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"萨沙，我这么对你说吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是个反抗者，只是个普通的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"名字？不重要，任何人都不该记得我的名字，这个名字不该成为符号，也不能有别的力量。它只是我的名字，也只是个名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你想的话，只是现在，你可以叫我塔露拉。叫这个名字，可以让我回头，但也就只是这样了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":"avg_npc_085","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"伊诺也可以这么叫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"有些话可能对你们还太早......但我还是想说给你听，萨沙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":"avg_npc_085","isRemote":false,"text":"你说吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望你叫我塔露拉，是因为把我当做朋友。当做志同道合的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"即使我死了，你也会记得这个名字，但不是因为我在我的一生里做了什么事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我只希望你记得我与你共处时的那些事。我希望你记得的塔露拉是一个朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨沙","speakerId":"avg_npc_085","isRemote":false,"text":"可你在杀坏人。你在和他们战斗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"战斗的那个人我不想她有任何名字。因为我们每一个人都在战斗，我们所有人都是斗士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"不要低头跟着斗士的脚步去走。不要！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"不是所有人都是爱国者，我们每个人都会犯错。你要抬起头，看他走向哪里，而不是他们有着怎样的头衔，你闭着眼紧跟在身后。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"你记得的是你的朋友的名字。是和你朝夕共处的人的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"是给你喂特别辣的糖还咬着牙笑的霜星，是给你烧奇奇怪怪的蔬菜杂烩的老师，是绝不会放弃训练你的爱国者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"朋友，而不是斗士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我们所有斗士都没有名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_084","isRemote":false,"text":"......塔露拉姐姐，我不懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......我希望作为你的朋友，让你信任我，而不是让你因为我的身份信任我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"就像所有我的朋友们一样。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
